title ALES11 — Lotus's equal-power law, and the constant it keeps
prompt Continue the autonomous recur (baton prin recur): next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve design rounds, send each finished increment to origin and xykj61, STOP only at custody gates.
think Seventh increment of this recur, after ALES10 (pan) landed and pushed. No custody gate in reach — the Lotus ladder is pure local software.
think Lindy-first crux-first: three rungs deferred the same companion law in the same words — ALES4's fade, ALES10's pan, the README road-on all point at the EQUAL-POWER curve. The most durable unbuilt thing on the Lotus road is the law those three kept promising; the crux that makes it real is arithmetic the suite never had — a square root over the integers. Chosen over the smaller balance/width and transport-loop laps deliberately, to take the crux not the count-pad.
think The one crux: "equal power" MEANS the two squared weights sum to den². Build them from that fact — left_power = den·(den−pos), right_power = den·pos, summing to den² EXACTLY before a single root — and the amplitude weights are the floor square root of each. The power split is linear in pos; the sqrt bends the straight line into the quarter circle the ear hears as constant loudness. No trigonometry, no float. The linear law was linear in amplitude; equal-power is linear in power.
think The genuinely new piece is the bounded integer sqrt: a twelve-digit binary descent over a 2²⁴ domain (max_pan_den²), proven to its contract r² ≤ x < (r+1)² at the postcondition — no unbounded loop, no float. Constant power then survives isqrt truncation with a PROVEN bound: left²+right² ≤ den², and den²−(left²+right²) ≤ 2·(left+right)+2. At any usable den (100, 1000) the truncation is inaudible; the −3 dB center it buys (0.707 vs the linear 0.5) is the whole point.
think Fold and render are ALES10's shape unchanged — side_fader folds each channel's weight into the fader, each channel is ALES8's fader.render run once, StereoClip and max_pan_den reused from pan.rye whole (accrete-never-break: ALES10 untouched). The only sum in the suite stays ALES8's.
obs GREEN on first build across eight blocks. tame_style_check bans clean (power.rye carries ≥2 asserts per fn), the isqrt contract holds across a 0..4096 sweep plus the domain ceiling, the constant-power law holds for every position 0..den, center lands 700 each side on a 1000-sample track (0.707 vs linear 0.5). ALES10 and prior witnesses unaffected — power.rye is strictly additive.
obs Stamp read from the live jail clock (TZ=America/New_York → 122502); it reads slightly behind ALES10's 123000, a prior round's forward drift. Honoring never-fabricate (REDS 63) over cosmetic monotonicity — the index seats ALES11 newest-first by meaning. Dated stamps are never rewritten.
obs Honest scope kept explicit: a routing weight, not a psychoacoustic or electrical claim; purely local, no socket, no network, no keys, no funds, no real device, no real speaker. No custody gate reached.
loom witness=ales_power_witness cases=8 isqrt_sweep=4097 build=first_green tame=clean center_amp=700 linear_amp=500 ales10_regreen=1
