file lotus/README.md seated ALES11 in status, rungs, prove-list, road-on
recommend keep-going ALES12 — the equal-power crossfade over time (ALES4's fade bent the same way), stereo metering (an RMS is a square root), or offer the keeper the choice of both pan laws. No custody gate in reach.
